Subject: [PATCH] Add MS_GOTLSMLKEM build-time setting

Backport the build-time tlsmlkem default while preserving explicit module, workspace, source, and runtime GODEBUG overrides. Keep regression coverage in the existing Go 1.27 cmd/go test harness.
